 { Here is one more example illustrating the principle that the passed pawn annuls any other positional factors. } 1. { -KEY- } Rxd5 $1 { A splendid exchange sacrifice to support the a6-pawn. } Rxd5 2. Rc3 $1 Rd8 ( { After } 2... Ra8 $2 3. Bg2 ) 
